    "steam_appid": 3865540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865540/extras/1a417efebb78b869a99a661b8f756dd9.avif?t=1754076712\" width=192 height=192 /></span><strong>A fictional horror story about Tom, whose daughter underwent a heart transplant he tragically couldn't attend.</strong> As Tom drives to pick her up from the hospital, he finds only chaos. The facility is in ruins\u2014dark, abandoned, and eerily silent. Now, Tom must find his daughter in the shadowy halls of the desolate hospital and try to save her. But he faces a terrifying ordeal, as hostile forces lurking within attempt to kill him and drag him into their nightmarish world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865540/extras/1d417e71d6d1e2c0850ccaa5aeb1fba7.avif?t=1754076712\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865540/extras/1a417efebb78b869a99a661b8f756dd9.avif?t=1754076712\" width=192 height=192 /></span><strong>A fictional horror story about Tom, whose daughter underwent a heart transplant he tragically couldn't attend.</strong> As Tom drives to pick her up from the hospital, he finds only chaos. The facility is in ruins\u2014dark, abandoned, and eerily silent. Now, Tom must find his daughter in the shadowy halls of the desolate hospital and try to save her. But he faces a terrifying ordeal, as hostile forces lurking within attempt to kill him and drag him into their nightmarish world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865540/extras/1d417e71d6d1e2c0850ccaa5aeb1fba7.avif?t=1754076712\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
