        "notes": "Player Warnings:\r\n\r\nThe game contains intense horror scenes, violence, and blood-related content. It may evoke strong emotions and feelings of unease.\r\n\r\nIntended for adults or players with parental/guardian consent due to mature themes.\r\n\r\nIt is recommended to play in a safe environment and not during activities that require full attention (e.g., driving).\r\n\r\nIf you have a history of anxiety, panic attacks, or heart conditions, please exercise caution or consider avoiding the game.\r\n\r\nSudden audio and visual effects (jump scares) may occur throughout the gameplay.\r\n\r\nThe game may include scenes unsuitable for younger audiences \u2014 make sure it\u2019s appropriate for you.\r\n\r\nTake breaks during extended play sessions \u2014 your health and comfort come first.\r\n\r\nIf you feel unwell or overly stressed, stop playing immediately."
